<title>CANADA: Canada Nov new motor vehicle sales rise 0.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada Nov new motor vehicle sales rise 0.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New motor vehicle sales rose 0.5 percent seasonally adjusted in November to 105,165 units from an upwardly revised 104,682 (104,000) units in October, Statistics Canada said on Monday.</p>
<p>A Reuters survey of economists had forecast a 1.8 percent rise in November.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau, 613-235-6745))</p>
